  "review_note": "Reviewed M9 current returned-boot inventory/profile verification, all-current-voter matched proof and owned handoff after regained leadership, separate consent, exact synced quiescence consumption and fresh terminal capacity/slot release. Canonical compact records preserve the existing 4-KiB limit. Same-scope consent renewal handles Root drift before/after physical opening. All 1,572 frozen repository Rust/Cargo/configuration inputs match source; 914 distinct selected current-source cases pass in 929 passing executions. A retained first library run failed the unchanged 10-ms dispatch test; isolation and full confirmation pass without source changes, cause unproven. The maintenance operation driver, stop-consent refresh, empty/retired return qualification, grace/rolling/second-failure policy and deployed density remain required."
